2026-10-23T18:41:25.7237610Z    image gate: lees_place_cabin_1812 currey_1912_hardscrabble: verdict "differs", 2 difference(s) open: the lean-to's upstream side and roof slope show in the render, about 17 px of wall left of its gable; the plate draws the lean-to flat to the viewer with no side; the door and window heads stand at 1.7 m, about 1-2 px higher than the drawing's 1.5 m
