2026-10-23T18:59:43.9400419Z       gate: tools/check_published_residents.mjs unpacks every shipped record with the renderer's own unpackRecord and asserts it deep-equal to its source, the cohort exactly the index's letter_list_only households and none shipped twice; pack_letter_list.py --self-test (check.sh) proves the round trip and refuses a record the packing would make ambiguous. The cohort had reached 9.30 MiB as one file per name, most of it the same paragraphs.
2026-10-23T18:59:43.9403897Z   24x transformed — tools/pack_boot_sidecars.mjs (run by publish.sh) writes each scene's records packed against each other — every value three or more repeat shipped once in boot/shared.json — because a citation hundreds of records carry was paid for once per record on a first visit 1.51 MB over its 13 MB budget. scene-loader.js reads these and rehydrates; the records at their own URLs are untouched (T-2315)
2026-10-23T18:59:43.9405411Z       e.g. data/sidecars/1812/boot/part-0.json
