2026-10-23T18:59:44.0497323Z    self-test |    ok    a row that was never classified is refused, not read as clean
2026-10-23T18:59:44.0497828Z    self-test |    ok    a schema-1 measurement, from before classification, is refused — re-measure, not reinterpret
2026-10-23T18:59:44.0498244Z    self-test |    ok    an `exempt` list, even with a reason, is refused — the hand-kept list does not grow back
2026-10-23T18:59:44.0498427Z    self-test |    ok    an empty `exempt` map is not a list
2026-10-23T18:59:44.0498685Z    self-test |    ok    the finding names the invocation that wrote, not just the tool
2026-10-23T18:59:44.0498871Z    self-test |   self-test: every assertion fires when broken
2026-10-23T18:59:44.0498882Z 
