2026-10-23T18:59:44.0500790Z    self-test |    ok    a commented-out declaration is not a step
2026-10-23T18:59:44.0500955Z    self-test |    ok    two declarations are two steps
2026-10-23T18:59:44.0501144Z    self-test |    ok    the tool is taken out of a python command
2026-10-23T18:59:44.0501323Z    self-test |    ok    the tool is taken out of a node command
2026-10-23T18:59:44.0501480Z    self-test |    ok    a shell function names no tool
